      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6ae20ba2911217029f50dd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "601c20e7e5ebf233b16efb4924c0b5cbd646f6a47e35770c6c4c666226122402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11d80da9724df0c861776989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～真厉害呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c741806f4be0e57d017063169e5e987bd62934c17b8b2f8f905a90fc793837d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6e437244903e7a98e895409",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是了不起～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb74a45b964f8956c122deaa335646911c3a473a501e3ffa26711e6c4b7e425",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0643a14bad159dca2be714ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～这么多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd2feec29b56d3038386264da6d2ae609d4abfdf3ef9ca407a77a43639aec690",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae6baa8442c6bd57f206634b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎唷唷……",
      "source_fingerprint": "220aa73a8121ef3c546d66375a9e295e0859ff6ebdb8ffed25849e58aef6e818",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eececccdf80b28b60c706eac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "503ea01d77a7f82f77b9ee6777a86a4285a4d4da03480f36106ce31bfeb1d59f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fb329273a68107b95fa3ae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你已经看仔细了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e99b93ea6dec413b8b1999282dc3ad0c42530810f8447375ddac85f803f0124b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b2bbb23db4be59e359f1365",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96f8baed2d011aad977acc43c4aa88badb260290f43330652089a07e258cab50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66f8897a3ebf6ab2ab0fe2a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真困难呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eead4effa1d936bc7fd4bf930d95ee970189c493ac1e4af24c21bc04edf8141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f1014c27d63edc6dda7ead7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的奖励是这个喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "edf9c92674b081c5dbfd9f74eb1072ecbe8dd0e709c9153c0979b1aa40aa8aef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2e7a12417b6142ece1efd23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……哎呀，对不起。\r\n我觉得有点累……但没关系，\r\n我必须努力才行呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "44da7d0eb3cc2d926e69e510eef7a2800c790777be121c2b52b2946d85b14bf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5737088ca91fc32c7bea9a32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿咻……哎呀，\r\n我只是觉得身体有点沉重。\r\n开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1746ad7140aeed0d16c7badb9ac268870343e0dcfe9244df1c87c67778b898a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91e4724b6edb39a86748cccf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼！呼！\r\n……好，热身运动结束～\r\n今天可以做比平常严格的训练唷～",
      "source_fingerprint": "559536fa9040d7bae5e64dca8de9f7270ddfe397582ac161830cfb31bf2db521",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dc3370297bec86a2bff4ffd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终～于到训练时间了。\r\n我总感觉身体蠢蠢欲动呢。\r\n今天要好好卖力训练啰～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5e7f1b843184e5bc26269102e2c2ba2d262faf64010b1d11cd17a532df2eb79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba926194e8646cac2db355fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，今天要做什么训练呢？\r\n不管内容是什么，\r\n我都会活力十足地完成唷～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c5fd3ebe17394f0b604124b525aa37c2d3babfb47588f0a48861f11ffe4676e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2817bd530c276c1978099f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好很好。热身运动都做完了，\r\n用来补充盐分的脆脆腌菜\r\n也非常完美～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b74f0936ab708616a4ae3cd75b1a0a90968e7d0ce3e0f04664a1539e297b5b12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61e2971a9df57a630ef8c702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一、二、嘿～咻。\r\n伸展运动做好啰～\r\n开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf168865e198712c6f2a872c9084724baaa2d555f81148af3508c2b66163fcbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76c7acc96e2256df817a4ae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也一点一滴地累积努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8b4bedb50a3883f81d0de73895bfb6181dc99b2bfadcd6c7113343713c4828f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c3dfc2c375191e584fd620",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……坚持就是力量嘛～\r\n所以即使状态不太好，\r\n还是要跟平常一样努力才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3485ccb1803f9d8b2c121ced96ab879fa932f73702b5f647a63f6e651582f970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:793263e7627dc1e4f7776959",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸……呼……今天有点容易分心呢。\r\n必须好好深呼吸，\r\n绷紧神经才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd0c550dab2a62a9407e16d8d0d2eaf126727dab57774dbcb8c120e5a7bdc7bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1527e8d703553dd060b8ef03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嘿咻。\r\n必须打起精神才行呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3097849138b22f412843c471f094cef47ae5fa05343ad856f36f5b6cc16a4246",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86494a73a8e112283a698de1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……咦？接下来的行程是什么？\r\n感觉今天我精神有点恍惚，\r\n非常健忘呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "357ad6bdd451cbcc62380e67fca4727bca381300010dea0658ac6a4288d594a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9bbf639feed21bdfce489e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，又要参赛呀？\r\n感觉有点太匆忙了唷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cff35b9ed88cd90fc4863f5ba9da70ce8cd8684c46bd2482e5631256684e683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35da0fdb0c7ce18694457010",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近感觉一直在参赛呢。\r\n当然，既然要出场\r\n我就会全力以赴，只是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc6f4723336ba7b653e7119f8c4ae4b20f783dc63fc2a883dbd55fd44d3e3db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d0d05d03c2627d1750cac29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好很好，状态调整得很完美～\r\n接下来就去拿下胜利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf60996383506d31a508511d2dcccd81712284def25c4f0d98c49bef27a62321",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46a359632516441f9b0a6ca4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我都有好好加强训练啰～\r\n只要顺利发挥全力，\r\n一定就能获胜的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f221b9b4cb53c6e8d7aedecaccaf191fc981b3e6527ba3017865bac8744d2b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6bde75ae1e303361288496a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不放弃就一定能获得回报，\r\n我得向大家证明这点才行呢。\r\n拿出干劲上场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfe31ffa69084d2ec10f2752b3659678bf4d46d2ab6588ab1c4d7aafa314d6ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fc8d3f8f40b2ab8b1cbbd52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～这个时刻终于到了呢～\r\n我会好好活用自己累积的实力，\r\n去赢得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e58750adec18b1d857912c2b9cc195030738884860e5dbbed15072e0da5e4c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3325e117dc547622b4326735",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态调整得不错呢～\r\n虽然有许多强敌，\r\n但我会努力不输给她们的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "23ba6c68f1d60493cb00975be3dd49b91a371911becc4c61acbcf44cae404b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0627649e5c6600a61cdc632a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态非常完美唷。\r\n而且我事先有吃萝卜的脆脆腌菜，\r\n把肚子填得饱饱的了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29995a3cf233d9ba019fff06a52500b2301da5549936e393f28869a49334951b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f28ea412aa39baa28c365800",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一如往常，\r\n我只需要将训练累积的\r\n实力都发挥出来就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c026b5337d0dfb5c9ba9d320ae1c62f6c4c7f9970807ee8cf0a4cc1b12518d1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f459b7e73b5d75e232c2777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，差不多快轮到我出场了吧。\r\n那么，我上场了唷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "633f2e714f4e5fb0b66ba1da607a2054d91da40f31d761e1d0c42b151512aa71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89272f208e46cc2d0e26e5b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不太会紧张耶～\r\n毕竟该做的事情，我都尽力去做了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d42c76b84705adb568230f4e4f4657a4393b3071cead257f4c71de9535a9255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e32d16506cc5e71ef46a26a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坦白讲，我的状态不太好～\r\n不过，我必须坚持到最后，\r\n拿下胜利才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "114889834336e6648103e8dcdf308de279e50c8019172067fc5be3344bc84a84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284e8bbb7cfdc48c4a8c8a4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然状态实在称不上好……\r\n但正因为如此，\r\n才更要绷紧神经面对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c6493c9b4b9b8e6b42633f1549f1102bfa2bad95d1502d9504a43390f996f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d04109000f72c8ee44b1c834",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坚持到底是我的长处，\r\n努力朝胜利迈进吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ed005bb1cd41f947cb660ac43f4a99d12f4f7a7bbce644e357ef97581a8d8d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8991780ff570685a1ed114e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然状态不佳……\r\n但竞赛的世界就是如此。\r\n我会拿出全力，绝不心存侥幸的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a925d864d1c53d245ecd9fa3c2d492ff2f88abdf81b2a44f37c8051fa4718d75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c2411f39fb4c364435d583c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了好了，\r\n本来就不可能事事顺利。\r\n现在只能尽力而为了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "009e5f02cec918fba537c66ad45594f2e20a27de510fbf115bf447ab178108aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf5f2e66006bd13fbf0dcbd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了……无论状态如何，\r\n都只能尽全力奔跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63d5e959ba060b1f6be00ce0eb49e1a66fa5df736c83a9b66a2d1b9b9c57cfc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1881cabc93de29123abed91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8ac2b92626bc0ee3fe94eb2306a0ca43e845e47f2640cac63e477fccbc0cd7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3312896990a43c44d54bd605",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "503ea01d77a7f82f77b9ee6777a86a4285a4d4da03480f36106ce31bfeb1d59f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:706f31a28d9d217fd8658da9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿咻～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e730867d21ab965fbdb56902425110794664466bf5e3a29d2b7426b9a2b0d3fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8336d2e344eb6b8654982307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bae68a8b2b8162e04831e0e516100be08d54d4f8ed8f914126b4d922a5806ee7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56bf0cd45a881387d648b18f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f648cc071d9b560d6eaf438e418b83e701f2beac7368232313cd73d3367099ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b4a219a88f9fe6252c1454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b9c4953ab77964dbc5cd56b37bfe1a0df549263759f088f595dae547ba6bdb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c6066640cd38bfeedbed502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b52ec6a51ea86f04e77eb47b539df83710d70ffb623152a29d619d493402def",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9017a05b53328cb0a584b212",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很漂亮呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9de05c435403069571151c5e2c53526650698e25d9c59197729c3a27c802b69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c65831a549a0900d85bcbc46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受你诸多照顾了……谢谢你啰～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdcf5bf042789515349321745d652446665602cdfdb4762f8f8093fe885cb054",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63d9dfed5a0625734bc028f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "061a18631a01933c013125c416897eb46aeee462d9ad560ae5b281f8e8871937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f5df0685313f7261026216",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来～吧，要拿出干劲上啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8773b3ef5b1cc2743e29d210f8ffc26387b8db6ef1d2828c93e59c4e2c9a598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b08d78a83d72dae25827a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力以赴吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eaa6d4664a6a948d48352e7d645b17447ba029312ed3cf534ee9622c4a51e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3ffc517a43011062381207",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坚持到最后一刻吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d84ffbc472a10c365833521efb90e60df82e01f27c39bc4327ced2069d9131a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88db9a67c47d2ee200eb7814",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "061a18631a01933c013125c416897eb46aeee462d9ad560ae5b281f8e8871937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efb4d8db1da4843196fbed31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态非常完美唷。\r\n而且我事先有吃萝卜的脆脆腌菜，\r\n把肚子填得饱饱的了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29995a3cf233d9ba019fff06a52500b2301da5549936e393f28869a49334951b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3345b8b07bd367686c72624b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不放弃就一定能获得回报，\r\n我得向大家证明这点才行呢。\r\n拿出干劲上场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfe31ffa69084d2ec10f2752b3659678bf4d46d2ab6588ab1c4d7aafa314d6ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddf3d8e0aba80d7eba44e2bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "061a18631a01933c013125c416897eb46aeee462d9ad560ae5b281f8e8871937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3afce5dd2d399f6547c97152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そぉ～れ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0af0e609d48612e5f4280de4bc02c60aa6c4492163b538ebd30b503a46d3fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e8e075e0dee066b38457089",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还差一点……\r\n就只差一点了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f428c96603e7bd74ecfb5294683d98ae9307f4a10c47a4520ce9bdbc821c3ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89a35187049f1bcb329d92aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还没结束呢，下次一定要赢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e6933a45c826bb3ad57480df8b5cf85a25b3268b25693a0b90aa7b6dcd3ddc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38d9bcf4734f61a9b49817a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不甘心……必须继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d448252d5c0adff8bab4eb6cfe6df4fcde0470bec3e87b92a7eee92a91f166",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75139694c71c699385e40d21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……必须重新打起精神才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "046abaef32811ea96db69e3ab7f072e07d1af4bc58ed293cb18fe29fca578033",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0306a1305cc48280ddb5a9c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坚持终将获胜～就是这个意思吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbdb024a7f26dd3166ba30705d935a22f4fb6474251a7bb88a2da262ea2cce23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2829a748b9ad3110e3c8e1da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看见希望之光了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1dc1b6f602b0ec51497ad6a415d11e586185337d82608d2da40db11881f95c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6a5ec00e8af937251061a6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，去拿下胜利吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "997d6dd3b59c9e2815ebe8d325db8ca82390f11863d72fb763eff224d0a3242d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
